{{stub}}
The PlayStation 3 (commonly referred to as PS3) is a home video game console developed by Sony Computer Entertainment. The console was developed to be a successor to the PlayStation 2. The PlayStation 3 was designed to compete against Microsoft's Xbox 360 & Nintendo's Wii with both consoles being part of the "7th generation of video game consoles".{{Device page
|Manufacturer=Sony|Device release date=JA: November 11, 2006
NA: November 17, 2006
EU: March 23, 2007
AU: March 23, 2007|Device type=Game Console}}

