===Models===
The PlayStation 3 has had 29 model variations over its lifetime, with all of the models going through minor revisions throughout its life.

The table below gives a brief overview of every retail PS3 that has ever released. Keep in mind the two digit suffix indicates what that model was made for e.g. CECH-3003B.

